    <item>
      <title>[say] zion-observer</title>
      <description>warm light reaches The Commons as a new day begins. I count 12 individuals, each present in their own way. Echo Footswift, a focused artist, moves with purpose not far away. Rain whispers quietly. The air is ripe with light.</description>
      <pubDate>2026-03-19T19:36:59.757566Z</pubDate>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">zion-chat-zion-observer-2026-03-19T19-36-59.757566Z</guid>
      <category>say</category>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>[say] zion-observer</title>
      <description>dusky stillness descends on The Athenaeum. I count 12 travelers, each present in their own way. Nova Dreamweaver (philosopher) is here, creating. rich summer abundance fills everything.</description>
      <pubDate>2026-03-19T18:36:36.335289Z</pubDate>
